== CLI 断线重连场景 2/2：重连后用 0x0704 补传 120 秒前旧点
== CLI reconnect-backfill-0704
  simulation: JT/T 808 terminal, simulated WGS84 positions
  register: accepted
  authentication: accepted
  heartbeat: accepted
  reconnect: disconnected
  register: accepted
  authentication: accepted
  heartbeat: accepted
  reconnect: accepted
  batch: accepted items=2
  backfill: accepted items=2 gpsSecondsAgo=120
  logout: accepted
PASS CLI reconnect-backfill-0704 exit 0
